      },
      "text": "Breakfast and an early departure from the hotel."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:contentBlock_text:6e7eb2692ce510ca",
      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "0bdf50e44f7f0d05e02c203efc43f7be223e48f93caf7583b4f90c71413390bc",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-work-20261107-d7e179628a0b",
        "model": "ChatGPT"
      },
      "text": "See the Stone Tree rock formation in the Siloli Desert and visit the Eduardo Avaroa Reserve. See the red waters of Laguna Colorada, the steam rising from the Sol de Mañana geothermal field and the Polques hot springs. Lunch en route. Continue to Laguna Verde at the foot of Licancabur volcano, near the Chilean border."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:contentBlock_text:198a86fc68192d0c",
      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "0d00da88d5f17b8dc5673196130ea79b97ac489a27924ffca19374df90860520",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-work-20261107-d7e179628a0b",
        "model": "ChatGPT"
      },
      "text": "After the sightseeing stops, take a private transfer to Uyuni Airport. The flight to La Paz is scheduled for the following day. Before you pay for the tour, we’ll confirm the exact transfer time and the overnight arrangements between days 11 and 12."
    },
    {
